'''Big Peng Z''' (ビッグペンZ, ''Biggu Pen Z'', '''Big Pen Z''') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]]/[[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of [[Zackie Peng]] unique to the [[Big Peng Z Strikes]] event. He was added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Big Peng Z
|image = E 594.png
|appearance = [[Big Peng Z Strikes]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
While a standing range of 150 may be quite low, Big Peng Z actually takes that short standing range to further abuse his already high effective range of 500, leading to a terrifying piercing range of 350. To make things worse, despite his relatively low attack power, Big Peng Z has a 100% chance to inflict 50% [[Toxic]] damage, effectively destroying anything that isn't [[:Category:Cats with Toxic Immunity|immune]] or [[:Category:Resist Toxic Cats|resistant to Toxic]] in up to two hits. If that wasn't enough, Big Peng Z revives quickly in one second (only marginally slower than [[Death Angel Z-Onel]]'s 0.5 seconds) if not finished with a [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]], which allows him to cripple unsuspecting units as other supporting threats advance.

Fortunately, Big Peng Z's greatest strengths also happens to be his bane. He is vulnerable to Curse, which disables his Toxic ability and removes most of his DPS, while his Zombie trait allows the Holy Blast Cannon to Freeze him and tear large chunks of his health with every sweep.

